  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Dry, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A lightweight, cream-balm bronzer with a natural finish for an all-over sunkissed bronze or soft-sculpted look.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Colloidal Oatmeal: Soothes, smooths, and moisturizes skin.</p><p>- Grapeseed Oil: Is rich in protective antioxidants and nourishing vitamin E.</p><p>- Elderberry Extract: Visibly brightens and protects skin with high levels of vitamin C.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is cruelty-free and comes in recyclable packaging.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Swirl The Big Buffing Bronzer Brush (sold separately) or your favorite buffing brush into the formula.</p><p>-For a sunkissed look, blend and buff a warm shade onto areas where the sun naturally hits (cheekbones, bridge of nose, temples, and forehead).&nbsp;</p><p>-To softly sculpt, apply a cool shade near perimeter of your face, buffing inward. Focus application on hollows of cheeks, jawline, and temples.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Recycling Instructions:<br></strong>-Jar is made with 50 percent PCR (post-consumer recycled plastic).</p><p>-Once jar is empty, give it a thorough cleaning.</p><p>-Recycle jar and lid in your home recycling bin.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Colloidal Oatmeal: Soothes, smooths, and moisturizes skin.<br>-Grapeseed Oil: Is rich in protective antioxidants and nourishing vitamin E.<br>-Elderberry Extract: Visibly brightens and protects skin with high levels of vitamin C. <br><br>C15-19 Alkane, Jojoba Esters, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Tribehenin, Colloidal Oatmeal, Glycerin, Beeswax/Cera Alba/Cire D'abeille, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Silica, Bentonite, Sambucus Nigra (Elderberry) Fruit Extract, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Cera Carnauba/Cire De Carnauba, Mica (CI 77019), Fragrance, May Contain: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxide (CI 77492, CI 77491, CI 77499), Tin Oxide.  <br><br>.<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Dry, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A lightweight, cream-balm bronzer with a natural finish for an all-over sunkissed bronze or soft-sculpted look.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients: </strong></p><p>- Colloidal Oatmeal: Soothes, smooths, and moisturizes skin.</p><p>- Grapeseed Oil: Is rich in protective antioxidants and nourishing vitamin E.</p><p>- Elderberry Extract: Visibly brightens and protects skin with high levels of vitamin C.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is cruelty-free and comes in recyclable packaging.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Swirl The Big Buffing Bronzer Brush (sold separately) or your favorite buffing brush into the formula.</p><p>-For a sunkissed look, blend and buff a warm shade onto areas where the sun naturally hits (cheekbones, bridge of nose, temples, and forehead).&nbsp;</p><p>-To softly sculpt, apply a cool shade near perimeter of your face, buffing inward. Focus application on hollows of cheeks, jawline, and temples.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Recycling Instructions:<br></strong>-Jar is made with 50 percent PCR (post-consumer recycled plastic).</p><p>-Once jar is empty, give it a thorough cleaning.</p><p>-Recycle jar and lid in your home recycling bin.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Colloidal Oatmeal: Soothes, smooths, and moisturizes skin.<br>-Grapeseed Oil: Is rich in protective antioxidants and nourishing vitamin E.<br>-Elderberry Extract: Visibly brightens and protects skin with high levels of vitamin C. <br><br>C15-19 Alkane, Jojoba Esters, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil, Tribehenin, Colloidal Oatmeal, Glycerin, Beeswax/Cera Alba/Cire D'abeille, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Silica, Bentonite, Sambucus Nigra (Elderberry) Fruit Extract, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax/Cera Carnauba/Cire De Carnauba, Mica (CI 77019), Fragrance, May Contain: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxide (CI 77492, CI 77491, CI 77499), Tin Oxide.  <br><br>.<br><br><i